        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Work-related emotional and behavioral symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Feels over it, is more tearful driving home, snappy with partner and colleagues, and more cynical at work. Still enjoys time with partner, dog, and TV when not exhausted; not going out socially much. Still functioning at work but reports making more little mistakes and double-checking medications more."
      }
